# The web image builds from the repository root (it needs contracts/ and
# docs/data/), so keep everything else out of the build context.
.git
data/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/web/public/vendor
apps/web/public/data
apps/web/src/generated
docs/screenshots
docs/media
docs/lighthouse
*.log
.env*
!.env.example
